<title>CHINA: China's electricity output up 4.23 pct in Q1.</title>
<headline>China's electricity output up 4.23 pct in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>China generated 261.076 billion kilowatt hours of electricity in the first quarter, up by 4.23 percent compared with the year-ago period, the China Securities said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sales of power industry products reached 53.059 billion yuan ($6.39 billion) in the first quarter, it said.</p>
<p>($1.0 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
